OL,3,GNEWSANew Isles of Scilly passenger
OL,4,Aferry on way to UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new passenger ferry, set to start a
OL,7,F"new era of travel" to the Isles of
OL,8,FScilly, has set off on its journey to
OL,9,Fthe UK.
OL,11,FThe Isles of Scilly Steamship Group's
OL,12,Fnew passenger ferry, Scillonian IV,
OL,13,Fdeparted Vietnam for the UK at 06:00
OL,14,Flocal time on Saturday (23:00 GMT on
OL,15,FFriday), ahead of entering service in
OL,16,FMarch 2027.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
