OL,3,GNEWSANew Isles of Scilly passenger
OL,4,Aferry on way to UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 75m (246ft) vessel started the
OL,7,Ftwo-month voyage, travelling from Ho
OL,8,FChi Minh City via the Cape of Good
OL,9,FHope, which was the same route taken by
OL,10,Ffreight vessel Menawethan earlier this
OL,11,Fyear.
OL,13,FScillonian IV has the capacity to carry
OL,14,F600 passengers and will replace
OL,15,FScillonian III.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
